'''''Thymelaea procumbens''''' is a species of flowering plant in the family [[Thymelaeaceae]]. It is native to [[Portugal]] and [[Spain]].<ref name="POWO_833011-1" >{{cite POWO |id=833011-1 |title=''Thymelaea procumbens'' A.Fern. & R.Fern. |access-date=21 October 2024 }}</ref><ref name="fernandes">{{cite journal |last1=Fernandes |first1=A. |last2=Fernandes |first2=R. |title=Uma nova espécie do género Thymelaea Endl. |journal=Bol. Soc. Brot., sér. 2 |date=1952 |volume=26 |pages=265-274, plates I-VIII}}</ref>

